><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250604095609+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250604095611+10'00'" name="2dbba391-cd84-4ffe-bee7-4646bf4d5131" page="5" coords="60.000000,561.559692,269.428009,561.559692,60.000000,550.359314,269.428009,550.359314,60.000000,550.558716,282.462067,550.558716,60.000000,539.358337,282.462067,539.358337,60.000000,539.557739,280.332764,539.557739,60.000000,528.357361,280.332764,528.357361,60.000000,528.556763,191.708420,528.556763,60.000000,517.356384,191.708420,517.356384,60.000000,517.555664,268.895508,517.555664,60.000000,506.355286,268.895508,506.355286,70.003510,506.554626,159.493820,506.554688,70.003510,495.354279,159.493820,495.354309,60.000000,495.553650,265.694061,495.553711,60.000000,484.353302,265.694061,484.353302,70.003510,484.552673,278.395508,484.552673,70.003510,473.352325,278.395508,473.352325,70.003510,473.551697,265.342773,473.551697,70.003510,462.351318,265.342773,462.351318,70.003510,462.550659,102.531647,462.550659,70.003510,451.350311,102.531647,451.350311" rect="59.649979,451.000305,282.812073,561.909729" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This manuscript proposes specific changes to the wording,&#xD;structure and logic of the Oslo Sports Trauma Research Center&#xD;(OSTRC) questionnaires and discusses the likely impact of the&#xD;proposed changes on collected data.&#xD;–– Updated versions of the questionnaires (OSTRC-O2&#xD;and&#xD;OSTRC-H2)&#xD;are provided.&#xD;–– A range of general issues related to questionnaire use,&#xD;outcome measures, analysis methods and implementation&#xD;success are discussed, alongside areas needing further&#xD;research.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="595.276001,469.559692,779.276001,561.559692"
/></highlight
